		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "aa9df4d7-b0ad-4406-88b8-d89628fa9011"))
	(text "AUDIO: MAX98357A on BCM18 (BCLK), 19 (LRCLK), 21 (DIN).\nSD_MODE is left floating on the breakout's own pull-up. That is what the\nno-sdmode flag in config/config.txt.example selects - without it the\noverlay claims BCM4, which the OnOff SHIM needs for shutdown.\nGAIN floating = 9dB default. Speaker must be PASSIVE, 4-8 ohm." (at 63.5 254.0 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e905bc70-ed42-4ca4-998b-34dea41967c7"))
